AUDIO: 'Vibe coding has a serious security problem. Now, I built this internal dashboard using AI in about 10 minutes. And you can see here that I\'m logged in as one mentor who should only be able to see their own students. But, if I just change one number here in the request, you\'ll see that I\'m able to view an'

