[00:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you why this keeps happening and how you can fix the problems with vibe coded apps. Let\'s talk finally about security. Here\'s what changed. Someone builds an app in an afternoon and it\'s reading production data by dinner with no review'

