[08:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'They don\'t even know that this is a problem. They don\'t know the difference between a back end and a front end in the first place. And even if they do know, they have to remember to do that every single time perfectly for every app that they build forever with every'

[08:28] [scene:talk]
