[08:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'these features. And then really, the problem is that people don\'t do that. They want things to get done quickly. They\'re just prompting the AI model and as soon as they get what looks like a functioning result, they\'re done. So, the real question becomes, what would'

[08:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this app actually look like if the safety was just on by default? If it didn\'t depend on the AI getting it right or, you know, a person remembering to check. And that\'s exactly what I want to show you next, how you can fix this problem when you\'re doing these types of'

